  <!-- ================= HOW IT WORKS ================= -->
  <section class="sec" id="docs" style="padding-top:24px;">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head" data-reveal>
        <span class="eyebrow">From zero to orchestrated</span>
        <h2>Define agents. Draw the handoffs. Ship.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step" data-reveal>
          <div class="k">01 — Define</div>
          <h3>Describe each agent</h3>
          <p>Give every agent a role, a model, and the tools it can use. Keep them small and specialized.</p>
          <pre><span class="cm"># agents.yaml</span>
<span class="kw">planner</span>:
  model: <span class="st">claude</span>
  tools: [<span class="st">plan</span>]
<span class="kw">coder</span>:
  model: <span class="st">gpt</span>
  tools: [<span class="st">repo</span>, <span class="st">shell</span>]</pre>
        </div>
        <div class="step" data-reveal>
          <div class="k">02 — Connect</div>
          <h3>Wire the handoffs</h3>
          <p>Draw who delegates to whom. Add branches, merges, loops, and human-approval gates as needed.</p>
          <pre><span class="cm"># graph.flow</span>
planner <span class="kw">-></span> researcher
researcher <span class="kw">-></span> coder
coder <span class="kw">-></span> reviewer
reviewer <span class="kw">-></span> deployer
reviewer <span class="kw">-.fail.-></span> coder</pre>
        </div>
        <div class="step" data-reveal>
          <div class="k">03 — Run</div>
          <h3>Kick off a task</h3>
          <p>Send a goal. Agents pick it up, hand off, and drive it to done — while you watch every step live.</p>
          <pre><span class="cm">$ synthos run \</span>
  <span class="st">"ship onboarding flow"</span>

<span class="kw">✓</span> planner   decomposed
<span class="kw">✓</span> researcher 4 sources
<span class="kw">✓</span> coder     PR #482
<span class="kw">→</span> reviewer  reviewing…</pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

